["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ben Sasse on Faith, Family, and Facing Death Heidelberg Catechism shared governance accelerationism safetyism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-econtalk-把死亡视为最后的敌人而非最终话语/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>死亡是最後的敵人而非最終話語：前參議員借來的時間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晚期胰腺癌患者、前參議員 Ben Sasse 在借來的時間裡受訪：腫瘤已縮小超過80%，但可能無法治癒；他把死亡看作「最後的敵人而非最終話語」，並把行政越權的根源指向立法退縮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">胰腺癌</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡觀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"We’re postliterate postliterate secondary orality syllogism epithet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-grayarea-后文字时代-人人都在读-却没人再读长文/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>後文字時代：人人都在讀，卻沒人再讀長文</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國某天讀過書或文章的人，二十年間少了40%；比識字危機更值得警惕的是後文字時代——抽象思維、教育方式與政治傳播，正在隨長篇閱讀一起退場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">後文字時代</span><span class=\"tag\">注意力經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Using AI to Increase Your Intelligence &amp; Enrich Humanity | Dr. Fei-Fei Li ImageNet 空間智能 具身智能 多模態\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-huberman-视觉是智能基石-ai应增强而非取代人的能动性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>視覺是智能基石，AI應增強而非取代人的能動性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">視覺是智能的基石；AI 必須增強人的能動性而不是取代它；人類最珍貴的認知，恰恰從未上傳到互聯網。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">視覺</span><span class=\"tag\">ImageNet</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Disney: The Renaissance and the Empire CAPS story reels film rentals multiplane camera\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-acquired-迪士尼帝国由-espn-现金牛买下-也被它拖住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1af0576da27045e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:32:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>ESPN 四年利潤買下皮克斯漫威盧卡斯，也拖住了迪士尼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼三十年的帝國由 VHS 錄像帶和 ESPN 訂閱費兩座現金牛餵養；流媒體讓結構性優勢失效——IP 永生，但舊商業模式不再有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">現金牛</span><span class=\"tag\">IP 資產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Naval Revolution: Triumph and Disaster torpedo boat destroyer 30-knotters ram bow engine telegraph rebreather Normand boiler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-10-historyhit-鱼雷艇用1-的战列舰成本-逼出了驱逐舰兵种/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/71b0d2c1b954a484-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0810</span></div>\n<h2>撞角撞沉自家驅逐艦：1%成本魚雷艇催生的新兵種</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1908年，一艘380噸驅逐艦在演習中被1萬噸巡洋艦撞沉，35人遇難。這起悲劇背後，是魚雷艇用1%的戰列艦成本顛覆海戰，催生了驅逐艦。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海軍史</span><span class=\"tag\">驅逐艦</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"695. Elizabeth I vs The Catholics: The Shadow War (Part 5) cautionary towns fireships / hell-burners Politiques War of the Three Henrys\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-restishistory-philip-sidney-之死-英雄是被葬礼制造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>Philip Sidney 死於腿傷，成名於葬禮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英西冷戰轉入熱戰，Philip Sidney 終於在低地戰場迎來成名機會，卻死於一次並不致命的腿傷；讓他成為新教歐洲英雄的，是葬禮而不是戰功。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊麗莎白一世</span><span class=\"tag\">英西戰爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Dark Fiber Listening Network DAS (Distributed Acoustic Sensing) Dark Fiber OTDR (Optical Time Domain Reflectometry) VSP (Vertical Seismic Profiling) Geophone Rayleigh Scattering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-asianometry-暗光纤正在把海底变成全球最大窃听网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e6062bb8e32bd3b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>海底光纜正變成全球最大竊聽網：不是間諜，是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">分布式聲學傳感（DAS）讓普通光纜變成連續振動監聽器：油氣井勘測、地震監測、鯨魚追蹤、船隻反潛都用同一條技術鏈，海洋正在快速失去隱私。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗光纖</span><span class=\"tag\">分布式聲學傳感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The playbook for building high-talent-density teams | Adam Ward, Head of Talent at Cursor funnel of doom remainder hiring work sample / work trial talent engineer talent density pre-boarding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-lennys-招聘漏斗注定招到平庸的人-10x-只存在于团队里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e5f79e19f08aa8b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>招聘漏斗註定招到平庸的人，10X 只存在於團隊裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把招聘當銷售漏斗，你招到的不是最強的 20%，只是恰好那天回你消息的 20 個人。Adam Ward 說 talent density 是集體屬性，沒有 10X 的個人，只有 10X 的團隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">招聘</span><span class=\"tag\">人才密度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Shapur I: Rome&#x27;s Greatest Enemy? Shahanshah Ērānšahr Arsacid dynasty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-09-ancients-沙普尔一世-生擒罗马皇帝的最强宿敌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/185bf0c8eb3903d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0809</span></div>\n<h2>生擒羅馬皇帝的波斯王，其實是羅馬自己養出的敵人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沙普爾一世兩次摧毀羅馬大軍並俘獲皇帝瓦勒良，是羅馬東方最危險的敵人；但他的勝利更多是三世紀危機的果，而非因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">薩珊波斯</span><span class=\"tag\">羅馬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Thinking in Silico: Goodfire CTO Dan Balsam on Concept Manifolds &amp; a $1000/Month ML Research Agent LRH SAE BSF Predictive Data Debugging Affective Circumplex Silico\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-cogrev-模型是遗留代码库-可解释性是调试器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/76fca1fe34565d53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>模型是遺留代碼庫：可解釋性是調試器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">數據過濾與獎勵塑形其實是同一座山的兩面；模型是可分解的稀疏混合，可解釋性因此能直接干預訓練。Goodfire 用月費 1000 美元的 Silico，把這種調試自動化了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode #251 ... You Must Change Your Life, Pt. 2 - The Worlds That Make Us co-immunity symbolic immunity vertical tension base camp anthrotechnics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-08-philosophize-改变人生不是换信念-而是移动你的大本营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e87b1cc15318e66e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">35:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophize This!</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0808</span></div>\n<h2>改變人生不是換信念，而是搬出你親手搭的賭場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人不是站在世界對面的獨立主體，而是被環境、身體和符號免疫系統共同構成的產物；想改變人生，就要同時改信念、行動與世界，而不是只逼自己「想通」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯洛特戴克</span><span class=\"tag\">環境塑造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"505 – The Battle of Tinchebray Orderic Vitalis Henry of Huntingdon siege castle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-britishhist-亨利一世在坦什布赖靠下马步战加伏兵生擒长兄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>下馬步戰加伏兵：亨利一世生擒親哥的諾曼底決戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世讓騎士下馬步戰，再用隱蔽的第四梯隊側翼伏擊，生擒哥哥羅伯特，終結這場諾曼底爭奪戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">諾曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: Is DNA repair the secret to a long life? Whales and mole-rats offer tantalizing hints dormant virus double-strand break CIRBP (cold-inducible RNA-binding protein) Sirt6 Fucoidan NAD+\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-naturepod-长新冠或源于休眠病毒-dna修复或为长寿关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/15a972da91ae970c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">13:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>DNA修復才是長壽關鍵：弓頭鯨的修復蛋白已進入人體試驗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示近半數新冠住院患者體內潛伏病毒被再激活，一年後炎症和細胞損傷更高；而弓頭鯨等長壽動物的共同點不是抑癌基因，而是更強的DNA修復能力，相關藥物已進入人體試驗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長新冠</span><span class=\"tag\">潛伏病毒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Out of Ammo for Real + Are CCAs Dumb? CCA (Collaborative Combat Aircraft) AUKUS standoff munitions porcupine strategy man-unmanned teaming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-chinatalk-美伊战争打光了打中国的弹药-日本开始准备独自扛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4db31a40ea9a2794-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>美伊戰爭打光了打中國的彈藥，日本開始準備獨自扛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國把為對華戰爭儲備的遠程彈藥幾乎全打在了伊朗，中東基地準備放棄，日本因此改寫防衛戰略、準備先自己扛一段時間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防</span><span class=\"tag\">彈藥庫存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Disagree With Your Kids Without Fighting HEAR framework curiosity sandwich false polarization hedging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-raisinggh-别只让孩子换位思考-要让他看见你在听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41f3114355314dc3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">55:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>別教孩子共情，先讓他看見你在聽</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">讓孩子學會好好分歧，關鍵不是教共情或換位思考，而是用語言證明你在聽；HEAR 框架和好奇三明治可以立刻用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">分歧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What does a parent owe their child? PGT-A polygenic testing pleiotropy satisficing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-grayarea-胚胎筛选-父母该为孩子做到哪一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b28234367aefc8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>篩選胚胎不是盡一切可能，是道德綁架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基因篩選能降低疾病風險，但統計意義常被誇大，且可能加劇社會不平等。父母應追求「足夠好」而非「最優」，警惕商業公司的道德綁架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因篩選</span><span class=\"tag\">生育倫理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Weight of Fame: A Hollywood Tragedy lipectomy fen-phen primary pulmonary hypertension (PPH)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-cautionary-制片厂的合同里写着-女演员的身体不得改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>女演員合同鎖死體重：增重即違約，減肥即送命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1920 年代女演員 Molly 因體重增加被片方雪藏、走上手術檯；1990 年代新娘 Mary 因減肥藥芬芬喪命。當身體成為商業資產，懲罰與捷徑都通向同一個結局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span><span class=\"tag\">身體標準</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why did AMD just buy this REALLY WEIRD chip company? SRAM reticle size agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-techtechpotato-amd收购talus-押注模型定制芯片的未来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d473494a95916b2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AMD收購Talus：把AI模型燒進芯片，每秒跑1.7萬token</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AMD收購了Talus，一家為特定AI模型定製芯片、實現每秒17,000 tokens的初創公司。這標誌著AI推理走向非可編程、模型專用芯片的方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">AMD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How “Forgive and Forget” Buried a Church’s Dark Secret OALC mandated reporter forgive and forget\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-papertrail-教会用-原谅与遗忘-处理性侵-受害者被要求闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/031f7ffec8b5b0e0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">45:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>教會用「原諒與遺忘」處理性侵，受害者被要求閉嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明尼蘇達州一個封閉教派把「原諒與遺忘」寫進官方指引，讓性侵在內部消化、不進司法程序。一名檢察官把案子交給記者，才挖出跨三代的系統性掩蓋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教機構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The FCC&#x27;s New Robot Rules covered list conditional approval blue UAS list bad labs onshoring plan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-chinatalk-fcc-用一份笨规则-把中国机器人挡在门外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a805ef1f2e186f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>FCC 用一份笨規則，把中國機器人擋在門外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FCC 把移動機器人列入 covered list，新機型一律不能進口。理由不是技術多先進，而是供應鏈依賴越晚解決越難，所以寧可要簡單粗暴的規則，也不要精雕細琢的豁免。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"賈揚清：我所經歷的「人工智能已死」到「AI 顛覆世界」的數年鉅變丨串臺「聲東擊西」S10E24 Caffe AlexNet Agent FAIR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-whatsnext-单个智能体再强也成不了团队-ai需要生产关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AI沒殺死工作，Agent團隊才是真瓶頸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">賈揚清從Caffe到兩次創業，復盤AI十五年：模型能力已經夠用，瓶頸在怎麼讓一群Agent像人類團隊一樣協作，他還斷言AI沒帶來大規模裁員，只是替罪羊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chasing Trillion-Dollar Companies, Founder Ambition, Token Budgets, and Regulatory Capture with Sarah &amp; Elad punctuated equilibrium RSI ROIT regulatory capture exit tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-nopriors-三位万亿公司五年内出现-但下一个不会这么快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d8446c4650e10d7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>三位萬億公司五年內出現，但下一個不會這麼快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年內三家從零到萬億美元市值是歷史異常，不是新常態。真正稀缺的不是大市場，而是能在五年內跑到 500 億美元收入的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人退出</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Barry Ritholtz: How Not to Invest | Rational Reminder 421 halo effect Gell-Mann amnesia Sturgeon&#x27;s Law decumulation ESOP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-rationalreminder-亿万富翁的经济预测-和短视频里的理财建议一样不可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d88279cd5f22a944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>億萬富翁的經濟預測，和短視頻裡的理財建議一樣不可信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光環效應讓人把成功者的所有話當洞見，但他們在自己領域之外同樣一無所知；好建議謙卑且概率化，壞建議自信且具體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投資</span><span class=\"tag\">行為金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Weight Loss: Why Won&#x27;t It Stick? weight cycling visceral fat macrophage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-sciencevs-体重循环不毁代谢-健康行为比体重重要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>溜溜球節食不毀代謝，健康習慣比體重更決定壽命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">體重循環（溜溜球節食）不會永久破壞代謝，普通人的反彈增重很少造成肌肉流失；真正影響健康和壽命的是健康習慣本身，不是體重的上下波動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體重循環</span><span class=\"tag\">減肥</span>\n</div></div></a>"]